@startuml
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "User / Frontend\n(D3.js / Web UI)" as UI
box "Spring Boot Core Subsystem" #LightBlue
    participant "SimulationController" as Controller
    participant "SimulationService" as Service
    participant "GraphRepository" as Repo
end box

box "PostgreSQL" #LightSkyBlue
    database "Postgres DB" as DB
end box

box "Python Microservice" #LightGreen
    participant "FastAPI Service" as Python
    participant "MonteCarloEngine" as Engine
    participant "Claude Client" as Claude
end box

participant "Yahoo Finance API" as YFinance

== 1. Request & Data Fetching ==
UI -> Controller: POST /api/v1/simulations/run {userId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: executeSimulation(userId)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: findGraphByUserId(userId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT nodes, edges WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> Repo: User Graph Data
Repo --> Service: Graph Entity Structure
deactivate Repo

== 2. Inter-Service Communication & Market Data ==
Service -> Python: POST /api/simulate {GraphJSON}
activate Python

Python -> YFinance: Fetch 10-yr CAGR/Volatility (VOO, AGG)
activate YFinance
YFinance --> Python: Historical Price Data
deactivate YFinance

== 3. Math Computation & AI Prompting ==
Python -> Engine: run_monte_carlo(graph_data, market_metrics)
activate Engine
Engine --> Python: Percentiles [10th, 50th, 90th]
deactivate Engine

Python -> Claude: prompt_optimization(graph_json, simulation_summary)
activate Claude
Claude --> Python: Structured Refactoring Advice (JSON)
deactivate Claude

Python --> Service: Combined SimulationResultDTO
deactivate Python

== 4. Persistence & Response ==
Service -> Repo: saveSimulationSnapshot(results)
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO simulation_runs
DB --> Repo: Success
Service --> Controller: SimulationResultDTO
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK {Percentiles, CashFlows, AIAdvice}
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI: Render Net Worth Line Chart & AI Drawer
@enduml
